 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon Transcribe Service API (2017-10-26). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Custom vocabularies and vocabulary filters store inline Phrases and Words that are never applied to audio; vocabularies are READY at once instead of passing through PENDING, and no DownloadUri is returned. VocabularyFileUri, VocabularyFilterFileUri and DataAccessRoleArn are refused because the simulator reads no file from Amazon S3. ListVocabularies filters only by StateEquals; NameContains is refused. Transcription, medical, call analytics and Medical Scribe jobs, medical vocabularies (which need a file), custom language models (which train) and call analytics categories return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501.",
  "title": "Amazon Transcribe (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2017-10-26"
 },
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
